    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this wonderful three-bedroom apartment with two sunny south west facing balconies to the market in Millrace Green, Saggart, Co Dublin. This stunning property is situated in a prime location within walking distance of Rathcoole and Saggart Villages with their array of amenities. Avoca, local primary and secondary schools, The Luas and Rathcoole Park with its beautiful scenery and walking trails are but a few of the many attractions to this excellent location. \r\n\r\nBright, airy and most spacious living accommodation of C. 93 sqm briefly comprises of entrance hallway, large open plan living/dining area, fully fitted kitchen with storage press, three double bedrooms (one master ensuite) and main family bathroom. \r\n\r\nOff the two bedrooms to the rear of the property you have private balconies with a highly sought after south west facing orientation making it perfect for relaxing on them long sunny summer evenings whilst the front offers ample parking down the end of the cul de sac with no passing traffic.\r\n\r\nNo. 3 Millrace Green is presented in good condition throughout having been well maintained by its current owners and we see this one being extremely popular among a wide range of buyers such as first-time buyers looking to get on the property ladder or any keen investor looking to capitalise on the strong rents in the area. It boasts gas fired central heating, double glazed windows and extra spacious living. \r\n\r\nDo not miss this one; call Ray Cooke Auctioneers for further information or to arrange viewing! \r\n\r\nAdditional features; \r\n- BER C2 \r\n- c. 93 sqm \r\n- 3 bed 2 bath \r\n- Apartment \r\n- Located on the 2nd floor \r\n- Gas fired central heating \r\n- Double glazed windows \r\n- Good condition throughout\r\n- Two balconies off bedrooms \r\n- Entrance hallway \r\n- Fully fitted kitchen \r\n- Separate storage room \r\n- Large open plan living/dining area\r\n- Three spacious bedrooms \r\n- Built in wardrobes \r\n- Main family bathroom \r\n- Ensuite bathroom \r\n- Sunny south west facing balconies \r\n- Private and not shared \r\n- Ample communal parking to the front of the property \r\n- Exclusive development \r\n- Highly sought-after area\r\n- Bus routes on your doorstep \r\n- Within easy reach of Rathcoole and Saggart Village \r\n- Within easy reach of The M50 Motorway & The Luas \r\n- Ideal for 1st time buyers\r\n\r\nDirections\r\nFrom Red Cow, proceed along Naas Road. Continue through the lights at Newlands Cross and then take the 4th exit for Rathcoole / Saggart. At the roundabout turn left and follow the road ahead. At the next roundabout then take your second exit into the Millrace development. Within the development turn left onto Millrace Crescent and proceed straight then turn right and then right again onto Millrace Green where number 3 will be in the last block on the right."
      },
